I'm sorry about your father. I've passed your message to our life events team, and they will contact you. You can also reach them on 0117 496 0412, 09:00 to 17:30 on working days, or at lifeevents@fernhillwealth.example.

We will need:
- the original or a certified copy of the death certificate;
- details of the executors or administrators of the estate;
- the grant of probate or letters of administration (in Scotland, Confirmation) before assets can be released.

If the total value held with us is below £30,000, we can usually release assets to the personal representatives without a grant, against a signed indemnity. We provide a date-of-death valuation for the estate free of charge.
